      "source": "AST <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a> visitor. Visitor methods get called by segments on entering a <a href=\"Visitable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Visitable</code></a>, their child\n<a href=\"Visitable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Visitable</code></a>s and on leaving the <a href=\"Visitable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Visitable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "AST 的 `<a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a>` 访问者。当进入一个 `<a href=\"Visitable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Visitable</code></a>`、其子 `<a href=\"Visitable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Visitable</code></a>` 以及离开该 `<a href=\"Visitable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Visitable</code></a>` 时，访问者方法会被调用。",
      "count": 1
